        <type>bool</type>
        <definition>bool themis::llm::LLMCorrelationContext::isValid</definition>
        <argsstring>() const noexcept</argsstring>
        <name>isValid</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::llm::LLMCorrelationContext::isValid</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>true when:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1llm_1_1_l_l_m_correlation_context_1a988789b1d14a0eec5972d0bb5fac2958" kindref="member">trace_id</ref></computeroutput> is exactly 32 lower-case hex characters and is not all-zero, AND</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1llm_1_1_l_l_m_correlation_context_1a73e43908fc89508c282765a3983853d3" kindref="member">span_id</ref></computeroutput> is exactly 16 lower-case hex characters and is not all-zero.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
Enforces the W3C Trace Context spec: IDs must be valid lower-case hex and the all-zero value is explicitly forbidden as an invalid sentinel. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
