    <briefdescription>
<para>Lightweight correlation context for a single LLM pipeline invocation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Intended to be created once per request at the topmost entry point and threaded downward through all pipeline stages by value. Copy is intentionally cheap (two <computeroutput>std::string</computeroutput> fields of at most 32 characters each). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
